fter]] [[the]] [[storm]], [[we]] [[will]] [[need]] [[food]].\``,`vn`:`Ng\u00e0y th\u1ee9 hai, c\u1ea3 l\u00e0ng khu\u00e2n g\u1ea1o, n\u01b0\u1edbc, ga v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e8n l\u00ean ng\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng c\u0169 tr\u00ean \u0111\u1ed3i. M\u1eb9 T\u00ed cho m\u1ebb c\u00e1 cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng v\u00e0o t\u1ee7 c\u1ea5p \u0111\u00f4ng l\u1edbn \u1edf c\u1ea3ng. \`C\u1ee9 \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00e1 \u0111\u00f4ng \u0111\u00e1,\` ch\u1ecb n\u00f3i. \`B\u00e3o xong, m\u00ecnh s\u1ebd c\u1ea7n c\u00e1i \u0103n.\``},{`en`:`\`[[Is|be]] [[it]] [[a]] [[hurricane]]?\` [[asked|ask]] Ti. \`[[In]] [[some]] [[countries|country]] [[they]] [[call]] [[a]] [[storm]] [[like]] [[this]] [[a]] [[hurricane]],\` [[said|say]] Ms Thao. \`[[And]] [[will]] [[there]] [[be]] an [[earthquake]] [[too]]?\` \`[[No]]. An [[earthquake]] [[comes|come]] [[from]] [[under]] [[the]] [[ground]], [[not]] [[from]] [[the]] [[sky]].\` Ti [[looked|look]] [[happier|happy]]. \`[[Good]]. [[Then]] [[the]] [[storm]] [[can]] [[take]] [[my]] [[homework]], [[but]] [[not]] [[the]] [[school]].\``,`vn`:`\`C\u00f3 ph\u1ea3i si\u00eau b\u00e3o kh\u00f4ng c\u00f4?\` T\u00ed h\u1ecfi. \`\u1ede m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 n\u01b0\u1edbc, b\u00e3o l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 th\u1ebf n\u00e0y \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1ecdi l\u00e0 'hurricane',\` c\u00f4 Th\u1ea3o n\u00f3i. \`Th\u1ebf c\u00f3 c\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ea5t n\u1eefa kh\u00f4ng c\u00f4?\` \`Kh\u00f4ng. \u0110\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1eeb d\u01b0\u1edbi l\u00f2ng \u0111\u1ea5t, ch\u1ee9 kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i t\u1eeb tr\u00ean tr\u1eddi.\` T\u00ed t\u01b0\u01a1i t\u1ec9nh h\u1eb3n. \`May qu\u00e1. Th\u1ebf th\u00ec b\u00e3o c\u1ee9 cu\u1ed1n b\u00e0i t\u1eadp c\u1ee7a em \u0111i, mi\u1ec5n l\u00e0 \u0111\u1eebng cu\u1ed1n tr\u01b0\u1eddng.\``},{`en`:`\`[[Your]] [[homework]] [[stays|stay]] [[here]], [[dry]] [[and]] [[safe]],\` [[said|say]] Ms Thao. \`[[This]] [[week]], [[our]] [[environmental]] [[lesson]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[real]] [[one]].\` [[She]] [[carried|carry]] [[the]] [[school's|school]] [[plants|plant]] [[inside]]. [[She]] [[remembered|remember]] [[the]] [[house]] [[with]] [[the]] [[blue]] [[door]] [[on]] Lotus Street, [[where]] [[the]] [[plant]] [[in]] [[the]] [[upstairs]] [[window]] [[was|be]] [[always]] [[wet]].`,`vn`:`\`B\u00e0i t\u1eadp c\u1ee7a em s\u1ebd \u1edf l\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y, kh\u00f4 r\u00e1o v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n,\` c\u00f4 Th\u1ea3o n\u00f3i. \`Tu\u1ea7n n\u00e0y, b\u00e0i h\u1ecdc v\u1ec1 m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang ta l\u00e0 b\u00e0i h\u1ecdc th\u1eadt.\` C\u00f4 b\u00ea m\u1ea5y ch\u1eadu c\u00e2y c\u1ee7a tr\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0o trong. C\u00f4 nh\u1edb \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u00f4i nh\u00e0 c\u1eeda xanh \u1edf ph\u1ed1 Hoa Sen, n\u01a1i ch\u1eadu c\u00e2y b\u00ean c\u1eeda s\u1ed5 t\u1ea7ng tr\u00ean l\u00fac n\u00e0o c\u0169ng \u01b0\u1edbt.`},{`en`:`[[On]] [[the]] [[third]] [[day]], [[the]] [[air]] [[was|be]] [[warm]] [[and]] [[heavy]]. [[Nobody]] [[had|have]] [[much]] [[energy]], [[but]] [[by]] [[evening]] [[the]] [[old]] [[school]] [[was|be]] [[ready]], [[with]] [[beds|bed]], [[food]] [[and]] [[light]] [[for]] [[everyone]]. [[Then]] [[a]] [[cool]] [[wind]] [[began|begin]] [[to]] [[blow]] [[from]] [[the]] [[sea]], [[and]] [[the]] [[clouds|cloud]] [[turned|turn]] [[dark]]. Mr Lu [[looked|look]] [[at]] [[the]] [[sky]] [[and]] [[said|say]] [[nothing]].`,`vn`:`Ng\u00e0y th\u1ee9 ba, kh\u00f4ng kh\u00ed oi n\u1ed3ng v\u00e0 n\u1eb7ng tr\u0129u. Ch\u1eb3ng ai c\u00f2n m\u1ea5y s\u1ee9c, nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u1ed1i ng\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng c\u0169 \u0111\u00e3 s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng, \u0111\u1ee7 ch\u1ed7 ng\u1ee7, \u0111\u1ed3 \u0103n v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e8n cho t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi. R\u1ed3i m\u1ed9t lu\u1ed3ng gi\u00f3 m\u00e1t b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u th\u1ed5i t\u1eeb bi\u1ec3n v\u00e0o, v\u00e0 m\u00e2y chuy\u1ec3n m\u00e0u s\u1eabm. \u00d4ng L\u1eef nh\u00ecn tr\u1eddi, kh\u00f4ng n\u00f3i g\u00ec.`},{`en`:`[[At]] [[nine]] [[o'clock]], [[the]] [[radio]] [[spoke|speak]] [[again]]. [[The]] [[storm]] [[was|be]] [[coming|come]] [[faster|fast]] [[than]] [[people]] [[thought]]. [[It]] [[would]] [[arrive]] [[tonight]], [[not]] [[tomorrow]].`,`vn`:`Ch\u00edn gi\u1edd t\u1ed1i, radio l\u1ea1i l\u00ean ti\u1ebfng. C\u01a1n b\u00e3o \u0111ang di chuy\u1ec3n nhanh h\u01a1n m\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u01b0\u1edfng. N\u00f3 s\u1ebd \u0111\u1ed5 b\u1ed9 ngay \u0111\u00eam nay, ch\u1ee9 kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i ng\u00e0y mai.`}],`tease`:`B\u00e3o \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1edbm h\u01a1n d\u1ef1 b\u00e1o, ngay trong \u0111\u00eam nay. Ng\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng c\u0169 c\u00f3 gi\u1eef an to\u00e0n cho c\u1ea3 l\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng?`}]}